OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of murdered Stacy Hunter
OL,4,Asay new misogyny bill would not have
OL,5,Aprotected her
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family of Stacy Hunter has called
OL,8,Ffor immediate action to protect victims
OL,9,Fof domestic abuse, after plans for a
OL,10,Fmisogyny bill were announced by the
OL,11,FScottish government.
OL,13,FThe first minister announced plans to
OL,14,Frecognise misogyny as a "distinct form
OL,15,Fof prejudice and abuse" during his
OL,16,Fprogramme for government on Tuesday,
OL,17,Falongside a public health campaign to
OL,18,Ftarget toxic male behaviour.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
