OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of murdered Stacy Hunter
OL,4,Asay new misogyny bill would not have
OL,5,Aprotected her
OL,6,
OL,7,FHunter was murdered by her estranged
OL,8,Fhusband, who was on bail for attacking
OL,9,Fher. Her family is calling for tougher
OL,10,Faction on offenders.
OL,12,FSpeaking on BBC Radio Scotland's
OL,13,FMornings programme, Stacy's brother
OL,14,Fsaid while some aspects of the
OL,15,Fproposals are important, they are not
OL,16,F"anywhere near good enough".
